{#-
  An /llms.txt orientation index (llmstxt.org convention): a plain-Markdown map
  of this site for a language model or agent, so one fetch answers "what is
  this, how is it organised, and how do I read it correctly".

  A map, not an inventory. sitemap.xml already lists every page and image, and
  the archive pages enumerate themselves, so this file carries only what the
  pages cannot say about how to read them, plus the entry points and counts.
  Counts come from the same listed-only collections the archive pages use, so
  an unlisted photograph is never advertised here.
-#}
